 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Not at all. Many adults begin learning a language then. The key is starting with simple vocabulary and building from there. Everyone starts there. Focus on pronunciation first, and you can fix the grammar later. Both are wonderful choices. If you want practical language for travel, go with Greek. If you' also interested in history, Portuguese opens up lot of Brazilian films and music. With beginners' course, even a short course, you' see progress within weeks. And don't be shy, practice with a tutor or language exchange partner.",
